{"about_the_game":"Three shapes. Two choices. One weapon. Enter a minimalist multiplayer FPS world where you knew the rules before you played the game. ShapeRockets is the world\u2019s first literal online Rock, Paper, Scissors shooter!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose Rock, Paper or Scissors - and shoot your prey shape or run from your predator shape. After a recharge, you can change your shape on the fly. Float in all directions in dark, minimalist arenas. Light the arena with your shape, your rockets, or the giant explosions from each kill. Jump in and experience action that\u2019s simple, but far from simplistic with the constant standoff moments of rock, paper, scissors. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThree hits and you\u2019re dead. Three deaths and you\u2019re out. It\u2019s &quot;Last shape floating&quot; in ShapeRockets! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay online with 2-8 people. A simple lobby system makes joining a game fast and hosting a game easy. Also, play single player tutorial levels where you can discover a hidden story as you learn the basics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEchohead is a new indie studio from Matt Cox, lead designer of the original Scribblenauts.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"81ebf0c334a7ee3e06c0eb98d77fe90dbed01cda.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome","name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/531480/81ebf0c334a7ee3e06c0eb98d77fe90dbed01cda.jpg"},{"icon":"fa69a04f77801eec282f562880f4488c9d1878ac.jpg","localized_name":"Tutorial for the Soul","name":"Tutorial for the Soul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/531480/fa69a04f77801eec282f562880f4488c9d1878ac.jpg"},{"icon":"adee472665d6adbffe5548b8fa22287fb9786f83.jpg","localized_name":"Lights Out","name":"Lights Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/531480/adee472665d6adbffe5548b8fa22287fb9786f83.jpg"},{"icon":"8512445608ded8fdc3cbbb34f21757a7fd357eee.jpg","localized_name":"Tu-story-al